    {
      "name": "Introduction",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 76,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 130,
          "text": "Sunvale was an orchard company in the Lower Levels that grew and canned fruit back when the supply lines still ran. Its tins are still turning up in the lower decks, and no one on the Station can make a tin like these today.\n\nThis guide will provide everything you need to know to appraise the value of any Sunvale canned fruit.",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "サンヴェイルは、補給路が整っていた頃に、下層世界で果物を育てて缶詰にしていた果樹園企業です。その缶詰は今も下層で見つかりますが、今のステーションには、同じ缶詰を作れる者はいません。\n\n本ガイドでは、あらゆるサンヴェイル果実缶詰の価格を判断するために必要な情報を掲載いたします。",
            "zh": "桑维尔是下层区的一家果园公司，在补给线还畅通的年代种植水果并制成罐头。它的罐头至今仍会在下层甲板被翻出来，但如今空间站里没人能做出同样的罐头。\n\n本指南将提供鉴定任何桑维尔水果罐头价值所需的全部信息。"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "top",
          "fontSize": 6,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 212,
          "w": 150,
          "h": 56,
          "text": "Regardless of condition, a Sunvale tin has a base value of 170 Credits, and a minimum value of 30 Credits.",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "状態に関わらず、サンヴェイル缶詰の基本価格は170クレジットで、最低価格は30クレジットです。",
            "zh": "无论品相如何，桑维尔罐头的基础价值均为170信用点，且最低价值为30信用点。"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "top",
          "fontSize": 6,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 206,
          "y": 208,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 160,
          "sprite": "cg_full",
          "fit": "stretch"
        }
      ],
      "template": "guide_page",
      "slots": {
        "header": "Station Trade Commission",
        "title": "Sunvale Canned Fruit Appraisal Guide",
        "body": ""
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Fruit",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 74,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 14,
          "text": "1. Fruit",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "1. 果実",
            "zh": "1. 水果"
          },
          "style": "label",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 7.5,
          "color": "#355271"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 90,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 26,
          "text": "The picture on the label tells which fruit is inside. The rarer the fruit, the more a tin is worth.",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "ラベルの絵で、中身の果実が分かります。珍しい果実ほど、缶詰の価値は高くなります。",
            "zh": "标签上的图案表明里面是哪种水果。水果越稀有，罐头越值钱。"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "top",
          "fontSize": 5.5,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 124,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 63,
          "sprite": "cg_fruit_peach",
          "fit": "stretch"
        },
        {
