    {
      "name": "Lid",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 74,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 14,
          "text": "2. Lid",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "2. ふた",
            "zh": "2. 罐盖"
          },
          "style": "label",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 7.5,
          "color": "#355271"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 90,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 26,
          "text": "How the lid opens tells the generation of the tin. The oldest tins have no opening feature at all and need a can opener. Nobody makes those any more.",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "ふたの開け口で、缶の世代が分かります。いちばん古い缶には開け口がなく、缶切りが要ります。今は誰も作れません。",
            "zh": "罐盖的开法表明罐头属于哪一代。最老的罐头完全没有开启结构，需要用开罐器。如今没人再做了。"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "top",
          "fontSize": 5.5,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 124,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 63,
          "sprite": "cg_lid_opener",
          "fit": "stretch"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 120,
          "y": 124,
          "w": 170,
          "h": 63,
          "text": "Plain Lid: 1st Generation (Years 361-379)\n(+120 Credits)",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "開け口のないふた：第1世代（361〜379年）\n（+120クレジット）",
            "zh": "无开启结构的罐盖：第1代（361-379年）\n（+120信用点）"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 6,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 202,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 63,
          "sprite": "cg_lid_ring",
          "fit": "stretch"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 120,
          "y": 202,
          "w": 170,
          "h": 63,
          "text": "Ring-Pull Lid: 2nd Generation (Years 380-414)\n(No Change)",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "リングプルのふた：第2世代（380〜414年）\n（変化なし）",
            "zh": "拉环罐盖：第2代（380-414年）\n（价格不变）"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 6,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 280,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 63,
          "sprite": "cg_lid_broken",
          "fit": "stretch"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 120,
          "y": 280,
          "w": 170,
          "h": 63,
          "text": "Broken Ring-Pull\n(-20 Credits)",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "リングが取れたふた\n（-20クレジット）",
            "zh": "拉环断掉的罐盖\n（-20信用点）"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 6,
          "color": "#373541"
        }
      ],
      "template": "guide_page",
      "slots": {
        "header": "Station Trade Commission",
        "title": "Sunvale Canned Fruit Appraisal Guide",
        "body": ""
      }
    },
    {
