        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 90,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 26,
          "text": "Rust creeps in at the lid and the rim first, then runs down the sides.",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "さびは、ふたと縁から広がり、やがて側面へ流れ落ちます。",
            "zh": "锈蚀先从罐盖和边缘开始，然后顺着罐身流下去。"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
