    {
      "name": "Swelling",
      "elements": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 74,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 14,
          "text": "5. Swelling",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "5. ふくらみ",
            "zh": "5. 鼓胀"
          },
          "style": "label",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "middle",
          "fontSize": 7.5,
          "color": "#355271"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 90,
          "w": 258,
          "h": 26,
          "text": "A tin that has swollen has food that has gone bad inside. The lid bulges up into a dome and the sides bulge out. Never eat one.",
          "translations": {
            "ja": "ふくらんだ缶は、中の食べ物が傷んでいます。ふたはドーム状に盛り上がり、側面は外へ膨らみます。決して食べないでください。",
            "zh": "鼓胀的罐头里面的食物已经变质。罐盖会鼓成圆顶，罐身也会向外凸出。千万不要吃。"
          },
          "style": "body",
          "align": "left",
          "valign": "top",
          "fontSize": 5.5,
          "color": "#373541"
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "x": 28,
          "y": 124,
          "w": 84,
          "h": 63,
          "sprite": "cg_swell_flat",
          "fit": "stretch"
        },
        {
